Package: winterolympics
Type: Package
Title: 2026 Winter Olympics Performance Prediction Utilities
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Pete", "O'Hanlon",
      email = "pete@example.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Tidyverse-oriented tooling that normalizes athlete-event datasets
    to a canonical list of 116 Milan-Cortina 2026 winter events, reconciles
    event naming variants, and enforces per-event medal probability constraints.
    Produces a cleaned athlete database and diagnostics to support medal
    prediction workflows.
